 of pediatric adverse outcomes and improve patient safety</article-title><year>2003</year><conf-name>Workshop presented at Pediatric Academic Societies Meeting</conf-name><conf-date>December</conf-date><conf-loc>Seattle</conf-loc></citation></ref><ref id="b8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hall</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Dornan</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>What patients like about their medical care and how often they are asked: a meta-analysis of the satisfaction literature</article-title><source>Soc Sci Med</source><year>1988</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>935</fpage><lpage>939</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3067368</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hickson</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Clayton</surname><given-names>EW</given-names></name><name><surname>Githens</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Factors that prompted families to file medical malpractice claims following perinatal injuries</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1992</year><volume>267</volume><fpage>1359</fpage><lpage>63</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1740858</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hickson</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Federspiel</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Pichert</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Patient Complaints and Malpractice Risk</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2002</year><volume>287</volume><fpage>2951</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12052124</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-